Product Description
This Anself disposable mop pads can seem convenient, but they actually cost you money every time you clean. With these reusable dust and mopping pads, there's no need to waste money or make more trash.&nbsp;
Get a set of 2 washable mop pads, designed to fit all of the best-selling standard mop heads, including dry and wet jet mops. With 2 adjustable tabs, the reusable dust pads attach on strongly and securely to most sizes and stay on while you're cleaning.
    Then, simply detach and throw in the washing machine to get a completely clean pad.&nbsp;
These soft microfiber mop heads are great for dry dusting. In addition to being super absorbent for light spills, they also grab and catch pet hair, dust, allergens, and other dirt from hardwood floors.&nbsp;
They're soft enough that you can use them on any surface safely, from wood to metal to ceramic tile and vinyl. Each microfiber pad is good for up to 100 washes and with two, you've always got one clean and ready for whatever mess life throws at you.

